[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000300_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000300_01_0010","text":"凛世酱你知道吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000300_01_0020","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000300_01_0030","text":"复活节，在国外好像是学校都会放假\n那种级别的活动哦……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000300_01_0040","text":"……！\n那真是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000300_01_0050","text":"嗯……！\n复活节，希望在日本也能普及起来呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000300_01_0060","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000300_01_0070","text":"只是……\n可能和……春假……比较接近……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000300_01_0080","text":"啊确实！\n那就以春假变得和暑假一样长为目标……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000300_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000300_01_0090","text":"──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31000300_01_0100","text":"──啊哈哈／──呵呵呵……"}]
